---
title: dinyd · references in documents
config:
  look: handDrawn
  handDrawnSeed: 5
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    mainBkg: "#333333"
    clusterBkg: "#242424"
  themeCSS: |
    small { display: inline-block; text-align: left; }
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 300
---
%% Behavior authority: anchors.md.
flowchart LR
  subgraph Doc["referencing document"]
    Claim["restated claim"]
    Dest["Markdown destination"]
  end

  Claim -->|digest anchor| Evidence["selected evidence<br/><small>code region · document unit · file</small>"]
  Dest -->|local link · import| Path["referenced path<br/><small>file · directory</small>"]
  Dest -->|path of a bound digest anchor| Evidence

  classDef em fill:#173d25,stroke:#86efac
  class Claim em
